"projectSpecificDetails": "345 East 17th Street Apartments brings a modern, boutique living experience to the rich streetscape of Gramercy. From its elegant fa\u00e7ade and oversized windows to its inviting double-height lobby and serene interiors \u2014 with a fresh, contemporary point of view. It features Air Conditioning, Accessibility, Dishwashers in unit, Washers and dryers in units, High-end countertops and finishes, Split unit heating and cooling, High-end kitchen appliances, Smoke free, Pet friendly with a weight limit of 45 LBS. Service animals are an exception. Common area Wi-Fi, Elevator, Online payment options, High-speed internet, Security cameras, **Gym-spa-yoga, **Rooftop terrace, **Business Center, **Podcast room**Additional fee. Tenants are responsible for electric, electric stove, electric heat:ccASHP, and electric hot water.\n",
